{
  "slug": "tofu-vegetable-stir-fry-noodles",
  "name": "Tofu and vegetable stir-fry noodles",
  "description": "Seared tofu stir-fried with cabbage, carrot and mushrooms, tossed with noodles and a little sriracha — soy sauce is left out so the dish carries no wheat.",
  "iconKey": "bowl_dash",
  "instructions": [
    "Cube the tofu, pat it dry and sear it in the canola oil over high heat for 5 minutes, turning once, until crisp at the edges.",
    "Add the garlic, the mushrooms and the carrot and stir-fry for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the cabbage and the salt and stir-fry for 2 minutes more, until the cabbage is just wilted.",
    "Fold in the spinach, then the cooked pasta, tossing until everything is coated and hot.",
    "Stir the sriracha through and divide between two bowls."
